Z||000017||firstfiero||11-19-2001||07:13 AM||||     Dude I don't give a ****  if you worked in a video game store for 50 years! I played the xbox and it's another piece of microsoft crap. The joystick is the worst piece of junk I ever touched. And yes I will buy it because it's cheaper. I don't need to pay an extra 100 bucks to have a modem or play dvds. That's what I have a computer and oh yea a DVD PLAYER for. It's my opionion and ya know what when it comes to spending MY money it's all that counts. I know around here I've asked my kids and the teenagers who work for me and they all say know one is talking about the xbox only the gamecube. <BR>    By the way I got my reviews from <A HREF="http://www.videogames.com" TARGET=_blank>www.videogames.com</A>  . Where I have gotten all my info for the last 5 years or so. It used to be owned by electronic gameing monthly. Get a real job dude and maybe you won't have to put white walls on your fiero. lol<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
