Z||000026||btoth||11-19-2001||01:23 PM||||I felt bad for the Jaguar system and Neo-Geo.  They were just too far ahead of their time.  Same thing that happened with DreamCast. Didn't the Turbo Graffix 16 beat Nintendo and Sega to the 16-bit market? Even the original Playstation took a while to catch on.  I rember saying "how does Sony expect to compete with Nintendo and Sega?"  I guess they did somehow.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
