Z||000061||lou_dias||11-21-2001||12:36 PM||||I'm nuetral but I do hate Microsoft:<P>So Madden 2002 on the cube won't use the extra ports?  Yeah right...<P>A 500mhz PPC cpu is twice as powerful as a Pentium 3 733mhz.  It's call instructions per clock cycle.  PPC chips do more per clock cycle.  Winner - Gamecube.<P>The memory pack for the XBOX is if you want to take your save game to your friend's XBOX.  Obviously you aren't going to pull out the hard drive.<P>The reason they decided not to include a Dreamcast emulation layer in the XBOX is that would only increase Sega's wallet and not Microsoft.  Now Sega can release XBOX-specific versions and pay the licensing fee to Microsoft.<P>Are you guys like 12?||||reg||1
